        "description": "A feature is a promise of behaviour; closing it without acceptance criteria and the expected result closes a promise that was never made testable.",
        "effect": "refuse"
      },
      {
        "id": "completeness-issue",
        "rule": {
          "kind": "require_fields",
          "fields": [
